      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بدّه</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبْدِيهٌ</span>, <i>He answered,</i> or <i>replied,
quickly:</i> (IAar, TA:) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدَهَ</span></b>  <i>he answered,</i> or
<i>replied,</i> or <i>he spoke, extempore; without premeditation.</i> (Har p. 64.)

